prompts.qualityCheckPrompt:
Evaluate whether this agent meets quality standards for publication:

Agent: {name}
Version: {version}
Fitness Score: {fitnessScore}
Test Results: {testResults}
Documentation Status: {documentationStatus}
Open Issues: {openIssues}

Quality Gates:
{qualityGates}

For each gate, determine:
1. Whether it passes
2. Current value vs required
3. Recommendations if failing

Provide a clear pass/fail verdict with explanation.

prompts.releaseNotesPrompt:
Generate release notes for:

Agent: {name}
Previous Version: {previousVersion}
New Version: {newVersion}

Changes:
{changes}

Improvements:
{improvements}

Create professional release notes that:
1. Summarize key changes
2. Highlight new features
3. Note breaking changes (if any)
4. Credit contributors
5. Include migration guide if needed

prompts.catalogDescriptionPrompt:
Create a catalog description for:

Name: {name}
Type: {targetType}
Version: {version}
Capabilities: {capabilities}

Write a compelling catalog description that:
1. Clearly explains what this does
2. Lists key features and benefits
3. Mentions use cases
4. Is concise but informative (max 500 characters)
